"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410244004:1":{"text":"이해했어요. 원하는 목적지에 더 빨리 도착하는군요.","source_cn":"我懂了，是为了更快到达想去的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63EE4726BD7AD252","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410244005:0":{"text":"바로 그거야.","source_cn":"就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED9B086B85F36F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1410244005":{"text":"바로 그거야.","source_cn":"就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED9B086B85F36F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410244006:0":{"text":"기점은 깊은바위 마을이고, 정확한 종점은... 나도 잘 모르겠어.","source_cn":"起点是深岩村，至于确切的终点……我现在也不太确定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x260B23E01F8F101C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410244008:0":{"text":"휴! 얘기하자면 길어. 내가 학자도 아니고, 지금은 너희한테 역사 수업을 해줄 기분이 아니라구.","source_cn":"唉！这些事情说来话长，我又不是学者，现在没心思给你们上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4930D1CA66939FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410244009:0":{"text":"어쨌든, 이 승강기를 타고 